              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kasumi ako, abanyanzigwa ba Yuda na Benyamiini obu baahuliire abo abaazaahwirwe ngu nibombekera MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Isirairi Enju buhyaka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.17.24+2KI.17.25+2KI.17.26+2KI.17.27+2KI.17.28+2KI.17.29+2KI.17.30+2KI.17.31+2KI.17.32+2KI.17.33+2KI.17.34+2KI.17.35+2KI.17.36+2KI.17.37+2KI.17.38+2KI.17.39+2KI.17.40+2KI.17.41"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bakam 17:24-41",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bakagenda omba Zerubbabbeeri na hali abakuru ab'amaju g'abaisenkurubo, baabagambira bati: “Katwombeke hamu na inywe; ngira naitwe, turamya Ruhanga omu oumuramya, kandi tutaaha nitumutambira ebyonzira okuruga omukasumi k'Esalihadoni omukama w'Asiriya ayatuleesire hanu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu Zerubbabbeeri, Yeswa, n'abandi abasigaireho ha bakuru ab'amaju g'abaisenkurubo omu Isirairi, baabagambira bati: “Timwina bukwatane hamu naitwe, nukwo mutwombekese enju ya Ruhanga; baitu itwe itwenka, niitwe turaayombekera MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Isirairi, Sirasi omukama wa Paasa nkooku yaturagiire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu abasi b'ensi, nukwo kuterebura abantu ba Yuda, baabatiinisa kwombeka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "baataho n'okugulirra abandi b'amagezi babatange okuhikiriza eki bakaba bategekere kukora, akasumi koona aka Sirasi omukama wa Paasa, noobwakubaire okuhikira kimu ha ngoma ya Daliyo omukama wa Paasa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
