            "verseId": "EZR.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n        Esit 1:1.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukasumi k'Ahaswehero, akyatiire engoma ati, abantu bakahandiika, nibanyegerra enzaarwa za Yuda na Yerusaalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi omukasumi k'Atagizakiseesi, Bisiraamu, Mesiredaasi, Tabeeri n'abandi abasigaireho ha bagenzi baabo, bakahandiikira Atagizakiseesi omukama wa Paasa; ebbaruha egi, ekahandiikwa omu Rwaramaika, nukwo yahindurwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rrehumu omudumizi mukuru na Simusahi omuhandiiki, bakahandiikira Atagizakiseesi omukama ebbaruha n'erega Yerusaalemu, ebigambo byayo nibyo binu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebbaruha enu ehandiikirwe: Rrehumu omudumizi omukuru, Simusahi omuhandiiki, n'abandi abasigaireho hali bagenzi baabo, abacwi b'emisango, abalemi abakuru, abanyoro, Abapaasa, abantu ab'Ereki, Ababbabbilooni, abantu ba Suusa, nubo Ab'Erama, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'amahanga agandi agasigaireho, Osinapaara omukuru kandi ow'ekitiinisa aga yasuuhwire yagatwara omumbuga za Samaliya, n'omu kicweka ekindi eky'Isaza eriri nseeri y'ekisaaru, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "enu niyo kopi ey'ebbaruha eibaatwekere: Abairu bawe, nubo abantu ab'ensi ey'obuseeri, bw'ekisaaru, nibakuramukya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hati nitukumanyisa Abayudaaya abaarugire owaawe oku baija owaitu kunu, bakagenda Yerusaalemu. Nibombeka buhyaaka orubuga ruli orwaayemere kandi orubi; kutagira ebisiika babimazire, bali ha misingi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waitu Rukiraabasaija nitukumanyisa, orubuga runu obururaayombekwa buhyaaka n'ebisiika bikahwa, abantu tibarukwija kuha omusoro, ehooza rundi obusuuru, kandi sente ez'obukama niziija kukeeha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hati nkooku turukulya ha kisura ky'ekikaali, tikituhikiriire okurora omukama naaswazibwa, nukwo kutuma abantu kumumanyisa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nukwo baserre omu kitabu eky'ebihandiiko byaswenkuru. Omu kitabu ky'ebihandiiko ebi, nuho orukwija kurorra kandi nuho oraamanyira orubuga oru nkooku rwaayemere, nkooku rutalibaniza abakama n'ensi, kandi obwemi nkooku bwaarugire omurubuga oru okuruga ira. Eki nikyo kyaruleetire kuhwerekerra. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kinu nikyo turukumanyisa omukama, orubuga oru obururaayombekwa buhyaaka, n'ebisiika byarwo bikahwa, obu omunsi ey'obuseeri bw'ekisaaru toligaruka kutungayo kantu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama akagarukamu ati: “Nimpandiikira Rrehumu omudumizi omukuru, Simusayi omuhandiiki, na bataahi baabu abandi abasigaireho abanyakwikara Samaliya n'omu bicweka ebindi eby'ensi ey'obuseeri bw'ekisaaru, nimbaramukya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebbaruha eimwatutwekiire, bakaginsomera kurungi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaragira, baaserra, kikeetegerezibwa okuruga ira orubuga runu nkooku rwaikaire nirurwanisa abakama, obwemi n'obutahurra tiburuhwamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakama ab'obusobozi abaalemaga ensi yoona ey'obuseeri bw'ekisaaru, abaasasurwaga omusoro, ehooza n'obusuuru, bakalema Yerusaalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habweki, oteho ekiragiro, abantu abo balekere aho, n'orubuga rutagaruka kwombekwa okuhika obundakaragira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekintu eki otakigirra obugara; habwaki omukama ayongera kugwerwa akabi?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
